      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_Kalskag%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Reaching Upper Kalskag requires a small plane, a boat, or a winter ice road that follows the river.",
